      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEATHCOTE RUPEE (7) stalked the lead from a middle box and kept coming to win (30.56) at this track in Grade 5 over 525m. Well placed and will be tough to beat. GREYSYND BONNIE (4) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at Bendigo over 500m behind Brindle Road (29.09) in a Grade 5. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. IT'S BUBBLE TIME (6) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (30.79) last time in a Grade 4 at this track. Form here sound including two wins. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and two minor placings from six starts. Deserves plenty of respect. DOONGALLA MIMIC (3) must be among the chances on the last run here.",
